1 REM FBCS PRG-0070
2 REM CLAIM A-4.4.6-03
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 REM ANGLE, MAX and SIZE keep their keyword meaning in OPTION ANGLE / ASK MAX COLOR
110 REM and are plain identifiers elsewhere (4.4.6 l.1553-1557)
120 OPTION ANGLE DEGREES
130 LET ANGLE = 2
140 ASK MAX COLOR MAX
150 LET SIZE = 3
160 IF ANGLE = 2 AND SIZE = 3 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED ***"
170 END
